{"id":53172,"date":"2026-07-09T06:03:25","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T05:03:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-jorge-pina\/"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:23:30","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:23:30","slug":"corrida-jorge-pina","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-jorge-pina\/","title":{"rendered":"BNP Paribas 10\u00aa Corrida Jorge Pina 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">BNP Paribas 10\u00aa Corrida Jorge Pina 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>BNP Paribas 10\u00aa Corrida Jorge Pina para a Inclus\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no cen\u00e1rio moderno e ribeirinho do <strong>Parque Ribeirinho do Oriente<\/strong>, na freguesia de Marvila, em Lisboa. Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Jorge Pina<\/strong> com o patroc\u00ednio principal do BNP Paribas, apoios institucionais da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa e da Junta de Freguesia de Marvila e coordena\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>, a corrida \u00e9 um hino \u00e0 inclus\u00e3o social, \u00e0 cidadania ativa e ao desporto adaptado.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com tra\u00e7ado totalmente plano e r\u00e1pido ao longo da marginal do Rio Tejo, o programa inclui a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (17h00), a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (17h05) e as <strong>Provas Jovens dos 500m aos 1500m<\/strong> (a partir das 16h00). Todos os atletas inscritos t\u00eam direito a dorsal personalizado, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip Xistarca (10km), refor\u00e7o de abastecimento na meta e aos 5km, e medalha finisher comemorativa.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Setembro de 2026 \u0